": "0031", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". c. acc. et inf., wait for, ἦ μένετε Τρῶας σχεδὸν ἐλθέμεν; wait ye for the Trojans to come nigh?"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 4.247", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐ μενῶ πόσιν μολεῖν E. Andr. 255", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; μένον δ' ἐπὶ ἕσπερον ἐλθεῖν they waited for evening's coming on,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 1.422", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.;"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐκ ἔμειν' ἐλθεῖν τράπεζαν νυμφίαν Pi. P. 3.16", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τί μένεις . . ἰέναι; why wait to go?"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Thgn. 351", "author_abbreviation": "Thgn.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; μένω δ' ἀκοῦσαι I wait, i.e. long, to hear,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Eu. 677", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ag. 459", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(lyr.). (Cf. O"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pers.", "author_abbreviation": "Pers.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "man- 'wait', Lat. maneo.)"}]}